### 2.1 Introduction

The \(N\)-dimensional Ising model is a \(N\)-dimensional Ising model, with \(N\) spins \(\theta_{\rm o}\) and \(\theta_{\rm o}\). The model is a \(N\)-dimensional Ising model, with \(N\) spins \(\theta_{\rm o}\) and \(\theta_{\rm o}\).

