This theorem states that any spherical stellar system with an ergodic equilibrium df that satisfies \(f_{0}^{\prime}(E)<0\) is stable to radial perturbations. Proofs are given by Doremus, Feix, & Baumann (1971) and Kandrup & Sygnet (1985).

